# Material for mitt_body.obj.
#
# Flat colour, NO texture map - deliberately. See meshes/README.md.
#
# The upstream Fuel model ships a 753 kB photographic body texture. It was
# tried in two locations (beside the mesh, and in materials/textures/ per the
# gz convention) and did not render under gz-sim in either: the mesh loads with
# no warning of any kind and simply appears untextured. Rather than keep a
# three-quarter-megabyte asset in the repo that does not draw, the body is a
# flat colour that renders identically in Gazebo and RViz.
#
# It is also the more honest picture. The texture is a photographic Hummer
# skin, and this mesh is standing in for a Land Rover Defender-style ride-on -
# so the badging and grille detail would have been actively misleading on a
# vehicle that is not that.

newmtl mitt_body
	Ns 12.0000
	Ni 1.5000
	d 1.0000
	illum 2
	Ka 0.82 0.83 0.85
	Kd 0.88 0.89 0.91
	Ks 0.06 0.06 0.06
	Ke 0.0000 0.0000 0.0000
